                <pb facs="0359" n="261" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg261"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Goodnow to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-02"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Delivered your message. Li says Tsungli Yamen wired him they are seriously
                    considering his proposition to send ministers Tientsin.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goodnow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
